  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 596e78bc42dd47746b5c2aca0af9beb9, type: 3}
  m_Name: PumpyGeneric
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  themeTrack: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - characterName: Pumpy
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb16993dd754ef740abe171dd3d8078e, type: 3}
    text: The fertilizer of a cool dude! That's easy. Clumblisator just died and
      he was the COOLEST.
    typingSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 960a12ba55bdb0743a9f410db4710109, type: 3}
    effect: 0
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    expression: 0
    emoteTrigger: 
  - characterName: Pumpy
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb16993dd754ef740abe171dd3d8078e, type: 3}
    text: He was always the center of attention, to the point that he sometimes felt
      left out of being normal.
    typingSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 960a12ba55bdb0743a9f410db4710109, type: 3}
    effect: 0
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    expression: 0
    emoteTrigger: 
  - characterName: Pumpy
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb16993dd754ef740abe171dd3d8078e, type: 3}
    text: But it seemed all he needed was to be near his best friend Mollia. Her
      encouragement was everything to him.
    typingSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 960a12ba55bdb0743a9f410db4710109, type: 3}
    effect: 0
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    expression: 0
    emoteTrigger: 
  - characterName: Pumpy
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb16993dd754ef740abe171dd3d8078e, type: 3}
    text: That and a little something to take the edge off... HAHA.
    typingSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 960a12ba55bdb0743a9f410db4710109, type: 3}
    effect: 0
    typingSpeed: 0.03
    expression: 0
    emoteTrigger: 
